dical History (disease conditions, medical treatment, medication, etc. asthma, infections, cancer, other diseases)</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50"><italic>Behavioural &#x00026; Cognitive</italic></td><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">Anxiety, depression, hyperactivity, sleep Cognitive attributes (learning and memory, &#x02018;intelligence')</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50"><italic>Molecular</italic><xref ref-type="fn" rid="t1-fn1"><sup>a</sup></xref></td><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">RNA expression Proteomics (mass spectrometry; antibody profiling) Metabolomics Microbiome metagenomics</td></tr></tbody></table><table-wrap-foot><fn id="t1-fn1"><p><sup>a</sup>Types of samples to analyze: saliva, plasma, serum, urine, breath, skin (stem cells), feces (microbiology).</p></fn></table-wrap-foot></table-wrap></floats-wrap></article>